{"availability":"available","full":"akazah/prompt-anonymizer","name":"prompt-anonymizer","description":"A buddy check for your prompts — before they reach an LLM. On-device, reversible anonymization that catches the PII you didn't mean to send.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":30,"forks":1,"created":"2023-06-02T09:57:38Z","updated":"2026-07-22T13:49:51Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://akazah.github.io/prompt-anonymizer/","topics":["anonymization","chatgpt","chrome-extension","data-privacy","japanese","llm","llm-privacy","llm-security","local-first","openai","pii","pii-anonymization","pii-detection","presidio","privacy","prompt-engineering","pseudonymization","tauri","transformers-js","webgpu"],"demo":"https://akazah.github.io/prompt-anonymizer/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:54.058Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:54.058Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:54.058Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T13:19:54.058Z","stars":30,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["English | 日本語 | Español | Tiếng Việt | 中文 | 한국어 | Français | Deutsch | Português | Italiano","Why not just use Presidio? Use Microsoft Presidio directly if you need a general-purpose PII detection / anonymization framework. Prompt Anonymizer uses Presidio as the engine of its Python core and adds the LLM round-trip workflow on top: consistent placeholders, anonymized prompt out, local restore after the response — plus browser, extension and desktop surfaces that need no Python at all.","Why not LLM Guard? LLM Guard is a solid Python-side guardrail suite with its own Anonymize/Deanonymize. Prompt Anonymizer differs in three ways: multilingual detection across ten languages with locale-specific structured PII (checksum-validated national IDs such as My Number, per-region phone formats), non-developer surfaces (paste text in a browser page — no Python setup), and a codebase small enough to actually read."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/akazah/prompt-anonymizer/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c7dbddfbf9d7ce2ff11ad2a368789c7fcba771f1bb2d9179ef93760d2cbcf0de","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:54.209Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:54.209Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"English | 日本語 | Español | Tiếng Việt | 中文 | 한국어 | Français | Deutsch | Português | Italiano","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/akazah/prompt-anonymizer/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"c7dbddfbf9d7ce2ff11ad2a368789c7fcba771f1bb2d9179ef93760d2cbcf0de","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/akazah/prompt-anonymizer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:54.210Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-07-22T13:49:51Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/akazah/prompt-anonymizer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:54.211Z","hash":"c7dbddfbf9d7ce2ff11ad2a368789c7fcba771f1bb2d9179ef93760d2cbcf0de","originalBytes":22297,"storedBytes":22297,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["prompt-anonymizer","core","ner","python","docs","news","languages","pii","anonymize","phone","scan","text","cli","mapping","model","quickstart","backend","language","proxy","code","llm","see","spacy","web","browser","i18n","labels","mcp","number","prompt","readme","anonymizer","before","bert-base-multilingual-cased-ner-hrl","both","desktop","detection","label","local","never","npx","promptanonymizer","recall","same","bash","claude","davlan","extension","location","models","on-device","restore","server","anonymization","check","chrome","custom","default","deny","download","email","entities","gate","iban","install","pattern","react","vue","when","any","below.","demo","entity","every","hook","new","opt-in","person","plus","postal","presidio","runs","ssn","vietnamese","why","audit.md","client","credit","deanonymize","element","eval.md","explicitly","file","fono","golden","group","